          "inputTemplate": {
            "zh": "制作 1 张以主展示面为重点的包装设计确认图。依据已确认的包装结构，清晰展示消费者识别品牌与产品的主要画面，突出品牌标识、产品名称、核心图形、配色与信息层级，供用户确认主款视觉方案。\n\n{{product_info}}\n{{visual_direction}}",
            "en": "Create 1 packaging design approval image focused on the primary display panel. Use the confirmed packaging structure and clearly present the main view through which customers identify the brand and product. Highlight the brand mark, product name, core graphics, colors, and information hierarchy so the user can approve the master visual design.\n\n{{product_info}}\n{{visual_direction}}"
